    "summary": "Five drawers in one base can't be done in this system. Drawers only fit on the cut face of a half base, and a half base has exactly one cut face, so it takes one drawer. A full base and a quarter base take none. Notch drawers and bays would need more bases beside it, which the brief rules out. The build is now one north-half base (piece:0,0,0;half-n) with one drawer (drawer:0#0,0#cut). The checks found no rule errors and the mesh check reads clear. To get five drawers you would need more bases, or several half bases stacked."
